notes.content:
Changes:

 Updated demo version (current version 1.6.2);
 New musical accompaniment in some locations;
 Changed some sounds;
 Fixed a bug with an unreadable message in 1 act in the English version of the game.

What changed:

 Updated Makarov Pistol: a new model, sounds, updated animations;
 Improved and lightweight aiming system;
 Updated Specular map for the phone;
 Fixed minor bugs;


https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/34037466/c2dd87ddfa5c120c7a38f72a3609c7bfc5b1b50b.png

Second big update

What's new:

 Added a new game mode “Arena” - how long can you hold out against your own demons ?;
 Added a new firearm - MAC-10 (only for the "Arena" game mode);
 New achievement: "I met them";
 New achievement: "Seasoned";
 New achievement: "My soul belongs to the demons";


What changed:

 Fixed a defect related to sensitivity in the targeted mode;
 Fixed minor bugs;


About new game mode

"Arena"
In the "Arena" game mode you have to defend yourself from demons. In the start you have only a knife. In order to fight back - you need to look for loot: weapons, ammunition, medkits. The player in this mode, compared with the "Story" and "Hardcore", has improved parameters: more health and stamina, faster running, extended radius selection of objects.


At the beginning of the game you have 0 points. Every 10 seconds is awarded 10 points. Points are also awarded for killed monsters. When you reach a certain number of points the game becomes more difficult.
 
https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/34037466/514e3441633814dcc7363c40e678d53905656c1e.png

First big update

What's new:
 
 Added a new game mode “Hardcore” - complete the game without firearms and without the possibility to save;
  A new achievement: “More than alive”;
  New cutscenes and epilogue: there is no longer that terrible change of pictures on a black background, everything is dynamic;
  A flashlight for the gun;
  Corrected lighting system: in the dark now really see at least something;
  Partial replacement of music;
  Interaction button to activate the cutscene at the end of the first act;


What changed:
 
 Melee weapons are balanced: a knife to inflict more damage, increased the defeat range, accelerated attacks;
  Balanced sound volume;
  Removed the crossfair (white dot);
  Corrected animations for NPC: it is easier to get closer and stab them;
  Removed texture falling in some locations;
  Removed the bug with a “pigtail” in the reflection of the mirror of the protagonist;
  Improved optimization;
  Simplified selection of items;


If you found bugs - please send them to developer in a special section.

Contact:
mishanotest@gmail.com

https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/34037466/0d717f5eae68674d39b1e5dd95fa0dbc707d2c65.png

Updated content, fixed bugs

What changed:

 Updated cutscene in prolog;
 Updated help windows for newbies;
 Player's shadow;
 Weapon balance corrected - "soft" aiming, new walking animation, increased player's stock;
 Updated sounds for NPC;
 Updated animations for NPC;
 Ragdoll body physics for NPC;
 Now if you do not have save, the game will not warn you about the beginning of a new game;
 Minor processing level design;
 Fix serious bugs - problems with the interacting with objects, stuck in textures;
 Fix animation failure when using TAB;
 Finalization of the English localization;
 Improved lighting;
[/ list]

I wish you a pleasant game!

If you find any bugs - inform the developer in this discussion.
